mindmap
  root(("QA/QC 2026+"))
    QA vs QC
      QA: process-oriented, preventive
      QC: product-oriented, corrective
      Testing is a major form of QC
    Static testing
      Reviews + static analysis
      No code execution
      Early, shift-left, finds defects directly
    Branch 1: ISTQB CTFL v4.0 test process
      Test planning
      Test monitoring and control
      Test analysis
      Test design
      Test implementation
      Test execution
      Test completion
    Branch 2: QA/QC job roles 2026
      Manual tester
      Automation engineer / SDET
      AI/LLM QA tester
      QA lead
      Quality engineer
      Process QA
    Branch 3: AI impact per role
      REPLACE: repetitive, well-specified output
      ASSIST: AI drafts, human verifies
      CANNOT REPLACE: judgement, context, accountability
